ount to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1010581,\"title\":\"My Fault\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w46Vw536HwNnEzOa7J24YH9DPRS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oz4U9eA6ilYf1tyiVuGmkftdLac.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister's mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":216015,\"title\":\"Fifty Shades of Grey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/63kGofUkt1Mx0SIL4XI4Z5AoSgt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7IGKrY1f1KfwMipx9wZC4NRgIdF.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When college senior Anastasia Steele steps in for her sick roommate to interview prominent businessman Christian Grey for their campus paper, little does she realize the path her life will take. Christian, as enigmatic as he is rich and powerful, finds himself strangely drawn to Ana, and she to him. Though sexually inexperienced, Ana plunges headlong into an affair -- and learns that Christian's true sexual proclivities push the boundaries of pain and pleasure.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":950396,\"title\":\"The Gorge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9nhjGaFLKtddDPtPaX5EmKqsWdH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1440098,\"title\":\"Drawn Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rpvddXbaQPOi0fB2HKWbZ3uUSg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i65y7cMae36K0giN0GRaMjAHUru.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Marfil, daughter of a powerful Spanish businessman, sees her life in New York turned upside down when she is kidnapped and released without explanation. Her father hires Sebastian Moore as bodyguard and, forced to spend every minute together, an inevitable attraction ignites in a world where nothing is as it seems.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4588,\"title\":\"Lust, Caution\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6c1tqfJEBuIyhQC19SLlLQAUAvJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lU1fQews2gye23PocVE48CsTmOQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During World War II, a secret agent must seduce, then assassinate an official  who works for the Japanese puppet government in Shanghai. Her mission becomes clouded when she finds herself falling in love with the man she is assigned to kill.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2251,\"title\":\"Unfaithful\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k8qn3o8AomSJd91HPpxQrw1KYN3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/egVj5Y9f79xPnyAQJmeDR0Uwow3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A New York suburban couple's marriage goes dangerously awry when the wife indulges in an adulterous fling.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":705996,\"title\":\"Decision to Leave\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zI8KZ4EdLUymWKX1YEkpZ0gtPUa.jpg\",\"bac